Your Gemini capsule is ~/public_gemini, at gemini://runv.club/~you/
You'll need a Gemini client to see it, Lagrange or Amfora for example.

The front page is ~/public_gemini/index.gmi. Gemtext is simple:

  # A heading
  A paragraph is just a line of text.
  => gemini://runv.club/~you/other.gmi a link
  * a list item

Files must be readable by others (chmod 644). Edit what is inside
~/public_gemini, but don't delete or replace the folder itself: the
server keeps a hold on it, and a new folder won't show up until an
admin resyncs it.
